---
// Hero.astro - Top Hero Section
---

<header class="relative pt-12 pb-16 px-4 max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Glowing background effect -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[300px] bg-cyber-neon/10 blur-[140px] pointer-events-none rounded-full"></div>

  <!-- Trust Badges Bar -->
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-8">
    <a href="https://github.com/glastor-core/pii-veil" target="_blank" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 text-xs text-slate-300 font-mono transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm">
      <span class="text-cyber-neon">★</span> GitHub Open Source
    </a>
    <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 text-xs text-slate-300 font-mono">
      ⚡ 100 µs Sub-Millisecond Latency
    </span>
    <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 text-xs text-cyber-neon font-mono font-semibold">
      🔒 Zero Cloud Egress
    </span>
    <a href="https://crates.io/crates/pii-veil-core" target="_blank" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 hover:border-orange-500 text-xs text-slate-300 font-mono transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
      <span>🦀 crates.io</span>
    </a>
    <a href="https://crates.io/crates/pii-veil-core" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center hover:opacity-90 transition">
      <img src="https://img.shields.io/crates/d/pii-veil-core?logo=rust&color=dea584&label=crates.io%20downloads" alt="crates.io downloads" class="h-[26px] rounded" />
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Headline -->
  <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    Stop PII & Secrets from leaking into LLMs. <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
    <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyber-neon via-cyber-cyan to-cyber-purple">
      In Sub-Milliseconds.
    </span>
  </h1>

  <!-- Subtitle -->
  <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-cyber-muted max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
    Deterministic, reversible anonymization and vault engine for <strong class="text-slate-200">LLM prompts, MCP agents, and streaming APIs</strong>.
    Zero Python/JVM bloat. No GPU overhead. 200x faster than Microsoft Presidio.
  </p>

  <!-- CTA Buttons -->
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-12">
    <a href="#demo" class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-cyber-neon hover:bg-cyber-neonHover text-cyber-dark font-extrabold text-sm sm:text-base tracking-wide transition shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(0,255,157,0.35)] flex items-center gap-2">
      ⚡ Try Live Demo Below
    </a>
    <a href="#enterprise" class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold text-sm sm:text-base border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 transition flex items-center gap-2">
      🏢 Enterprise On-Premise
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Quick Install Tabs -->
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-cyber-card/90 border border-cyber-border rounded-xl p-3 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-md">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-cyber-border pb-2 mb-2 text-xs font-mono">
      <span class="text-cyber-muted">QUICK INSTALL</span>
      <span class="text-slate-400">Multi-Market Distribution (v0.1.4)</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
      <div class="bg-black/50 p-2 rounded border border-cyber-border/40 text-left">
        <span class="text-cyber-muted block text-[10px]">CARGO (RUST)</span>
        <code class="text-cyber-neon select-all text-[11px]">cargo add pii-veil</code>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-black/50 p-2 rounded border border-cyber-border/40 text-left">
        <span class="text-cyber-muted block text-[10px]">PIP (PYTHON)</span>
        <code class="text-cyber-cyan select-all text-[11px]">pip install glastor-pii-veil</code>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-black/50 p-2 rounded border border-cyber-border/40 text-left">
        <span class="text-cyber-muted block text-[10px]">NPM (NODE.JS)</span>
        <code class="text-cyber-purple select-all text-[11px]">npm i pii-veil-node</code>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-black/50 p-2 rounded border border-cyber-border/40 text-left">
        <span class="text-cyber-muted block text-[10px]">HOMEBREW (MACOS/LINUX)</span>
        <code class="text-amber-400 select-all text-[11px]">brew install glastor-core/tap/veil</code>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
